<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

          <p>
            We had given you a loan way back and you had assured that you would make the payment on due date irrespective of whether you received your salary or not.
          </p>

          <p>
            In good faith we kept hearing your repeated assurances that you would pay at some given point of time, but that payment never came. Till date we have not received anything from you.
          </p>

          <p>
            In brief, you have cheated us and deceived us with false information and misled us with assurances which you never lived up to.
          </p>

          <p>
            And to top it all, you have vacated your home and fled god knows where. This is not the way to behave — taking money from someone and escaping without paying.
          </p>

          <p>
            Moreover, you have stopped answering our calls or replying to our several mails and messages.
          </p>

          <p>
            Do not for a moment think you will escape paying by using these methods. A time will come when we will catch up with you and then the consequences will be disastrous.
          </p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>{{company_name_show}} Team</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
